Package: PET
Type: Package
Title: Polynomial Approximation and Extrapolation for Average Treatment Effects
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: person("PET development contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "maintainer@example.invalid")
Author: PET development contributors [aut, cre] (provisional)
Maintainer: To be designated <maintainer@example.invalid>
Description: Implements polynomial approximation and extrapolation to the target
    average treatment effect under limited overlap, and its augmented version,
    following Orihara, Komukai and Li (2026) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2608.09329>.
    Supports binary treatments, continuous and binary outcomes, model formulas,
    external nuisance predictions, automatic hyperparameter selection, and
    trajectory diagnostics. Also implements two-parameter beta weighting for
    weighted average treatment effects. Internal nuisance models use generalized
    linear models; other learners are supported through external predictions.
    Package identity and maintainer metadata are
    provisional and must be replaced before public distribution.
